sentences.text:
8. Let the applicant-Ashish Kumar Srivastava @ Ashish Srivastava be released on bail in Case Crime No. 703 of 2019, under Sections 409, 420, 467, 468, 471, 504, 506 I.P.C., registered at Police Station Gomti Nagar, District Lucknow on furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of magistrate/court concerned, subject to following conditions:-
(i) the applicant will settle the grievance of the informant within a period of six months from the date of his release from custody, failing which this order will stand cancelled automatically after expiry of the aforesaid period;
(ii) the applicant shall not tamper with the prosecution evidence;
(iii) the applicant shall not pressurize the prosecution witnesses;
(iv) the applicant shall appear on each and every date fixed by the trial court.
.

